falycion giant queen spider~
the falycion spider queen~
The falycion spider queen drags herself up and launches at you.
~
Normally this foul beast wouldn't move, but your arrival coincides nicely with
its meal time! Twice as large as a normal falycion spider, the queen is built
for one purpose and that is to propagate the species. Covered in small,
spindly hairs and a large red cross on its abdomen, its eight eyes are all
focused squarely on you!
~
